*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: other ISO 8601 forms that the specification allows: seconds, the basic format, a week date, an ordinal date, a duration and an end with only the time. A reader must accept them. Writers should use the recommended forms, so a validator reports warnings.

